  "expression": "{{ \"User: \" + chat.user + \", Level: \" + (storage.level || 1) }}",
  "outputAs": "userStatus"
}
- Context Data: Extract data from context
{
  "expression": "{{ chat.lastMessage.content }}",
  "outputAs": "lastMessage"
}
- Static Computation: Compute expensive value once and cache it
{
  "expression": "{{ storage.items.filter(i => i.active).length }}",
  "outputAs": "activeItemCount",
  "executionMode": "static"
}
- Dynamic Value: Re-evaluate expression each time node is executed
