- Refresh All UI: Refresh all UI components after storage update
{}
- Refresh Specific Placement: Refresh only above_input components
{
  "placement": "above_input"
}

**Best practices:**
- Use refresh node after storage updates to force UI re-fetch
- Set placement to update only specific UI area (above_input, sidebar, modal)
- Without placement, all UI components refresh
- Useful in HTTP_TRIGGER workflows to show updated buttons/progress bars

